cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the methods it builds on (references in docs/)."
type: software
title: "Wind UQ surrogate framework: UQ metrics and surrogate models for plant-level wind power uncertainty"
abstract: "UQ metrics for wind time series (temporal, data-source, ensemble and spatial) and a surrogate workflow that maps them to calibrated plant-level wind power uncertainty: pinball-loss-optimal scale targets at observed plants, Gaussian process and other surrogates, validation on held-out plants, and predictive quantiles at unobserved plants. Documented framework with synthetic examples and tests, and a case study on 264 ERCOT wind plants of the public ARPA-E PERFORM data sets."
version: "1.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Henryutd2021/wind-uq-surrogate"
